	(gr_text "FABRICATION REMINDER - U1 VIA-IN-PAD\n\nOrder epoxy-filled, planarized, copper-capped vias (IPC-4761 Type VII).\nApply ONLY to the five 0.30 mm vias inside U1 exposed pad 17.\nOther vias: retain their specified treatment.\nIdentify the five vias in the fabrication drawing and order notes.\nConfirm selective treatment with the fabricator before production.\nThis reminder alone does not enable via filling/capping.\n\nUse this note:\n\nFill with nonconductive epoxy, planarize, and copper-cap\nONLY the five Ø0.30 mm vias within U1's exposed ground\npad 17. Provide a flat, solderable top surface. All other\nvias retain their specified treatment."
		(at 120.13 104.5 0)
